---
title: "WoRMS sync"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as user (sync menu)
    participant LT as labeltree-db
    participant W as WoRMS API

    alt from the web app
        U->>LT: POST /worms/jobs {kind: sync_tree, tree: taxonomy}
        LT-->>U: 202 Accepted, job status
    else scheduled
        Note over LT: cron runs manage.py worms_sync taxonomy<br>(retries after 10 s, 30 s, 1 min, 2 min)
    end
    LT->>LT: list the AphiaIDs in the latest revision
    par fetch, 4 at a time
        loop each AphiaID
            LT->>W: AphiaRecordByAphiaID +<br>AphiaClassificationByAphiaID
            alt answered
                W-->>LT: record, valid_AphiaID, lineage
                LT->>LT: new WORMS_RECORD row if changed,<br>else refresh fetched_at
            else timeout, connection error or 5xx
                LT->>LT: retry after 1, 2, 5, 12 s<br>still failing: add to failed, skip
            else HTTP 429
                LT->>LT: pause the whole job for Retry-After
            end
        end
    and poll
        loop about every second until finished
            U->>LT: GET /worms/jobs/{job}
            LT-->>U: progress, retrying, paused, failed
        end
    end
    LT->>LT: under the tree's publish lock: re-check the latest revision,<br>add a NODE_WARNINGS row for each node whose warnings changed<br>(none for nodes needing a failed record)
    U->>LT: GET /worms/warnings?tree=taxonomy
    LT-->>U: nodes with current warnings
